OL,3,GNEWSAHouse prices reach 19-year high
OL,4,Areturning to pre-crash levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe average price of a semi-detached
OL,7,Fhouse in Northern Ireland has exceeded
OL,8,Fthe level last reached in 2007 before
OL,9,Fthe property crash.
OL,11,FIn the third quarter of this year the
OL,12,Faverage price was #209,953, compared to
OL,13,F#205,169 in the third quarter of 2007.
OL,15,FThe effects of inflation means that
OL,16,Fhouses are still substantially cheaper
OL,17,Fin real terms today.
OL,19,FFor example average, full time wages in
OL,20,FNI are now about 70% higher in cash
OL,21,Fterms compared to 2007.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
